description:
Learn how to integrate Claude with Zoho Desk using Deluge custom functions to automatically draft private support responses and cut ticket resolution time.

1. In Zoho Desk, go to Setup -› Automation -› Workflow Rules and create a rule on Tickets upon 'Created'.
2. Add a Custom Function using invokeurl to send ticket description and subject to Claude API (api.anthropic.com/v1/messages).
3. Use zoho.desk.createComment() to inject the generated AI response into the ticket as an internal private comment for agent 1-click review.

API / tool used:
- name: Anthropic Messages API
- endpoint: POST https://api.anthropic.com/v1/messages
- scope: None
- docs: Anthropic API Reference

Code (deluge) - Zoho Desk Setup › Automation › Workflow Actions › Functions:
ticketId = input.ticketId;
subject = input.subject;
description = input.description;

promptText = "Draft a helpful customer support reply for this ticket. Subject: " + subject + "\nDescription: " + description;

msg = Map();
msg.put("role", "user");
msg.put("content", promptText);

messagesList = List();
messagesList.add(msg);

payload = Map();
payload.put("model", "claude-3-5-sonnet-20241022");
payload.put("max_tokens", 300);
payload.put("messages", messagesList);

headersMap = Map();
headersMap.put("x-api-key", "YOUR_CLAUDE_API_KEY");
headersMap.put("anthropic-version", "2023-06-01");
headersMap.put("content-type", "application/json");

response = invokeurl
[
	url: "https://api.anthropic.com/v1/messages"
	type: POST
	parameters: payload.toString()
	headers: headersMap
];

aiReply = response.get("content").get(0).get("text");

commentBody = Map();
commentBody.put("content", aiReply);
commentBody.put("isPublic", false);

deskHeaders = Map();
deskHeaders.put("orgId", "YOUR_ORG_ID");
deskHeaders.put("Content-Type", "application/json");

deskResponse = invokeurl
[
	url: "https://desk.zoho.com/api/v1/tickets/" + ticketId + "/comments"
	type: POST
	parameters: commentBody.toString()
	headers: deskHeaders
	connection: "zohodesk"
];

